{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12104260","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12104260","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:4:1210426001:0":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">奈拉</style>……","source_cn":"<style=highlight>奈拉</style>……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x62C75582D34D35D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210426002:1":{"text":"那个用钩索的女人是谁？！她好厉害！","source_cn":"那个用钩索的女人是谁？！她好厉害！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC5B94B775551D09","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210426003:1":{"text":"而且她竟然叫血薇帮的老大……姐姐？","source_cn":"而且她竟然叫血薇帮的老大……姐姐？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB2D885BEC44141B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210426004:1":{"text":"奈拉是我的妹妹，但她很久之前就死在了一场海难里。","source_cn":"奈拉是我的妹妹，但她很久之前就死在了一场海难里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AF467BEA1F365DE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210426005:1":{"text":"我也不知道为什么奈拉会变成亡灵，还成了水鬼帮的头。我会弄清楚，给大家一个交代。","source_cn":"我也不知道为什么奈拉会变成亡灵，还成了水鬼帮的头。我会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x40EBA3BF3359C466","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1210426006:1":{"text":"可恨的水鬼，把这里搅得一团糟！我的宝贝噢！你们太惨了！","source_cn":"可恨的水鬼，把这里搅得一团糟！我的宝贝噢！你们太惨了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11CCDDF201C4BBDD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1210426007:1":{"text":"索尼娅，大炮设计图不见了！","source_cn":"索尼娅，大炮设计图不见了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2083A93431FD088C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1210426008:1":{"text":"追！一定要把设计图带回来！","source_cn":"追！一定要把设计图带回来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD052EEB14A5D40F3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1210426009:1":{"text":"卢卡，你带人走水路追，我和呼金留下，以防水鬼再次突袭。","source_cn":"卢卡，你带人走水路追，我和呼金留下，以防水鬼再次突袭。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48460EFAD8387452","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1210426010:1":{"text":"交给我吧，我一定把设计图和那帮水鬼的脑袋带回来。","source_cn":"交给我吧，我一定把设计图和那帮水鬼的脑袋带回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A4DDED5EDDA231B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1210426011:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 魔法师大人，你能跟着卢卡去吗？设计图要是被水鬼抢走，那我们可就麻烦了！"